5-04-23 14:10:32.2463530 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D'), ('GR-TL075', 'M', '2022-12-21', 'Baboucarr Corr', 'Letter', 'Abdoulie Touray C/O Momodou Touray', '3959779', 'Abdoulie Touray C/O Momodou Touray was compensated D13,203 for a 22mX8m stipe from his plot, in letter to the GRC Abdoulie demanded a compensation D250,000.00', 'Y', '2023-01-26', 'Y', 'In Person', 'Y', 'Not applicable', 'Closed.', '2025-04-23 14:20:22.6841560 ', 20009, 21, 'D309& D6530 -GM', 'GERMP T&D');